msgstr "依每條條帶排序透明多邊形。速度更快，但可能產生圖形瑕疵"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:131
msgid "Per Pixel"
msgstr "逐像素"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:133
msgid "Sort transparent polygons per pixel. Slower but accurate"
msgstr "依每個像素排序透明多邊形。速度較慢，但較精確"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:153
msgid "Rendering Options"
msgstr "渲染選項"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:156
msgid "Half"
msgstr "一半"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:156 core/ui/settings_network.cpp:40
msgid "Native"
msgstr "原生"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:201
msgid "Internal Resolution"
msgstr "內部解析度"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:203
msgid ""
"Internal render resolution. Higher is better, but more demanding on the GPU."
" Values higher than your display resolution (but no more than double your "
"display resolution) can be used for supersampling, which provides high-"
"quality antialiasing without reducing sharpness."
msgstr ""
"內部渲染解析度。越高越好，但對 GPU "
"的要求也越高。高於顯示解析度的值（但不超過顯示解析度的兩倍）可用於超採樣，可在不降低銳利度的情況下提供高品質的反鋸齒效果。"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:204
msgid "Integer Scaling"
msgstr "整數縮放"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:204
msgid ""
"Scales the output by the maximum integer multiple allowed by the display "
"resolution."
msgstr "以顯示解析度所允許的最大整數倍數來縮放輸出。"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:205
msgid "Linear Interpolation"
msgstr "線性內插"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:205
msgid ""
"Scales the output with linear interpolation. Will use nearest neighbor "
"interpolation otherwise. Disable with integer scaling."
msgstr "以線性內插方式縮放輸出。否則將使用最近相鄰內插。請在啟用整數縮放時停用此選項。"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:207
msgid "VSync"
msgstr "垂直同步"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:207
msgid "Synchronizes the frame rate with the screen refresh rate. Recommended"
msgstr "將影格率與螢幕更新率同步。建議啟用。"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:212
msgid "Frame Pacing (Experimental)"
msgstr "影格節奏（實驗性）"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:213
msgid ""
"Provide the GPU with presentation timing for each frame to replicate "
"original frame pacing."
msgstr "為每個影格提供 GPU 呈現時間，以複製原始的影格節奏。"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:216
msgid "Duplicate frames"
msgstr "重複影格"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:216
msgid "Duplicate frames on high refresh rate monitors (120 Hz and higher)"
msgstr "在高更新率螢幕（120 Hz 及以上）上重複影格"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:221
msgid "Show VMU In-game"
msgstr "遊戲中顯示 VMU"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:221
msgid "Show the VMU LCD screens while in-game"
msgstr "在遊戲進行中顯示 VMU LCD 螢幕"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:222
msgid "Full Framebuffer Emulation"
msgstr "完整 Framebuffer 模擬"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:223
msgid ""
"Fully accurate VRAM framebuffer emulation. Helps games that directly access "
"the framebuffer for special effects. Very slow and incompatible with "
"upscaling and wide screen."
msgstr ""
"完全精確的 VRAM framebuffer 模擬。有助於直接存取 framebuffer 以實現特殊效果的遊戲。非常緩慢，且與升頻及寬螢幕不相容。"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:227
msgid "Load Custom Textures"
msgstr "載入自訂紋理"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:228
msgid "Load custom/high-res textures from data/textures/<game id>"
msgstr "從 data/textures/<game id> 載入自訂／高解析度紋理"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:232
msgid "Preload Custom Textures"
msgstr "預載自訂紋理"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:233
msgid ""
"Preload custom textures at game start. May improve performance but increases"
" memory usage"
msgstr "在遊戲啟動時預載自訂紋理。可能會提升效能，但會增加記憶體使用量"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:239
msgid "Aspect Ratio"
msgstr "長寬比"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:241
msgid "Widescreen"
msgstr "寬螢幕"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:242
msgid ""
"Draw geometry outside of the normal 4:3 aspect ratio. May produce graphical glitches in the revealed areas.\n"
"Aspect Fit and shows the full 16:9 content."
msgstr ""
"在正常 4:3 長寬比之外繪製幾何圖形。可能在顯露的區域產生圖形瑕疵。\n"
"等比適配並顯示完整的 16:9 內容。"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:247
msgid "Super Widescreen"
msgstr "超長寬比"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:248
msgid ""
"Use the full width of the screen or window when its aspect ratio is greater than 16:9.\n"
"Aspect Fill and remove black bars. Not compatible with integer scaling."
msgstr ""
"當螢幕或視窗的長寬比大於 16:9 時，使用完整的寬度。\n"
"等比填滿並移除黑邊。與整數縮放不相容。"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:251
msgid "Widescreen Game Cheats"
msgstr "寬螢幕遊戲金手指"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:252
msgid ""
"Modify the game so that it displays in 16:9 anamorphic format and use "
"horizontal screen stretching. Only some games are supported."
msgstr "修改遊戲使其以 16:9 變形格式顯示，並使用水平螢幕拉伸。僅支援部分遊戲。"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:253
msgid "Horizontal Stretching"
msgstr "水平拉伸"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:254
msgid "Stretch the screen horizontally"
msgstr "水平拉伸螢幕"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:255
msgid "Rotate Screen 90°"
msgstr "旋轉螢幕 90°"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:255
msgid "Rotate the screen 90° counterclockwise"
msgstr "將螢幕逆時針旋轉 90°"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:260
msgid "Per Pixel Settings"
msgstr "逐像素設定"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:263
msgid "512 MB"
msgstr "512 MB"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:263
msgid "1 GB"
msgstr "1 GB"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:263
msgid "2 GB"
msgstr "2 GB"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:263
msgid "4 GB"
msgstr "4 GB"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:301
msgid "Pixel Buffer Size"
msgstr "像素緩衝區大小"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:303
msgid ""
"The size of the pixel buffer. May need to be increased when upscaling by a "
"large factor."
msgstr "像素緩衝區的大小。當以較大倍率升頻時可能需要增加。"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:305
msgid "Maximum Layers"
msgstr "最大圖層數"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:306
msgid ""
"Maximum number of transparent layers. May need to be increased for some "
"complex scenes. Decreasing it may improve performance."
msgstr "透明圖層的最大數量。對於某些複雜場景可能需要增加。減少它可能會提升效能。"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:309
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "效能"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:311
msgid "Automatic Frame Skipping:"
msgstr "自動跳影格："

