"Force nearest-neighbor filtering for all textures. Crisper appearance, but "
"may cause various rendering issues. This option usually does not affect "
"performance."
msgstr "對所有紋理強制使用最近相鄰過濾。外觀更銳利，但可能導致各種渲染問題。此選項通常不影響效能。"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:385
msgid "Force Linear"
msgstr "強制線性"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:385
msgid ""
"Force linear filtering for all textures. Smoother appearance, but may cause "
"various rendering issues. This option usually does not affect performance."
msgstr "對所有紋理強制使用線性過濾。外觀更平滑，但可能導致各種渲染問題。此選項通常不影響效能。"

