msgstr "個別遊戲 VMU 重新命名警告"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:6935
msgid ""
"This looks like an auto-named Per Game VMU for A1.\n"
"Renaming it can stop Hollycast from auto-loading it while Per Game VMUs is enabled.\n"
"To restore automatic pickup later, rename it back to its original file name."
msgstr ""
"這看起來是自動命名的 A1 個別遊戲 VMU。\n"
"重新命名後，啟用「個別遊戲 VMU」時 Hollycast 可能無法自動載入它。\n"
"若要日後恢復自動載入，請將名稱改回原始檔名。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:6940
msgid "New name"
msgstr "新名稱"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:6987
msgid "No VMU selected."
msgstr "未選取 VMU。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:6992
#, c-format
msgid "Insert \"%s\" into:"
msgstr "將 \"%s\" 插入："

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:6999
msgid ""
"This looks like an auto-named Per Game VMU for A1.\n"
"Copy it first, then insert the copy into another slot."
msgstr ""
"這看起來是自動命名的 A1 個別遊戲 VMU。\n"
"請先複製，再將副本插入其他插槽。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7015
msgid "Per Game VMU"
msgstr "個別遊戲 VMU"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7045
msgid "No active shared VMU slots are available."
msgstr "沒有可用的啟用中共用 VMU 插槽。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7062
msgid "Controls Configuration"
msgstr "控制器設定"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7080 core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7098
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "動作"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7213
msgid "Mouse & Raw Input"
msgstr "滑鼠與原始輸入"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7221
msgid "Sensitivity"
msgstr "靈敏度"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7223
msgid "Mouse sensitivity for light gun and mouse emulation"
msgstr "光線槍與滑鼠模擬的滑鼠靈敏度"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7224
msgid "SensitivityPopup"
msgstr "SensitivityPopup"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7225
msgid ""
"Adjust the mouse sensitivity for light gun and mouse emulation. Higher "
"values make the cursor move faster."
msgstr "調整光線槍與滑鼠模擬的滑鼠靈敏度。數值越高，游標移動越快。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7249
msgid "SensitivitySetting"
msgstr "SensitivitySetting"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7250
msgid "Mouse/light gun sensitivity."
msgstr "滑鼠／光線槍靈敏度。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7253
msgid ""
"Sensitivity\n"
"Adjusts mouse and light gun sensitivity.\n"
"Higher values make the cursor move faster.\n"
"\n"
"Tip: tune this in actual gameplay (not just menus) and keep it consistent across devices when possible."
msgstr ""
"靈敏度\n"
"調整滑鼠與光線槍的靈敏度。\n"
"數值越高，游標移動越快。\n"
"\n"
"提示：請在實際遊戲中（而非只在選單中）調整，並盡可能讓不同裝置使用相同設定。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7269
msgid ""
"Use Raw Input\n"
"Enables raw input so multiple pointing devices (mice, light guns) and keyboards can be handled more accurately.\n"
"Recommended if you use light guns or multiple input devices."
msgstr ""
"使用原始輸入\n"
"啟用原始輸入，可更精確地處理多個指向裝置（滑鼠、光線槍）與鍵盤。\n"
"若使用光線槍或多個輸入裝置，建議啟用此功能。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7633
msgid "Adjust the size of the on-screen crosshair"
msgstr "調整螢幕準星大小"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7634
msgid "CrosshairSizePopup"
msgstr "CrosshairSizePopup"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7635
msgid ""
"Adjust the size of the on-screen crosshair for light guns. Only available "
"when a light gun device is connected."
msgstr "調整光線槍的螢幕準星大小。僅在連接光線槍裝置時提供。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7659
msgid "CrosshairSizeSetting"
msgstr "CrosshairSizeSetting"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7660
msgid "Crosshair size for light guns."
msgstr "光線槍準星大小。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7663
msgid ""
"Crosshair Size\n"
"Adjusts the size of the on-screen crosshair for light guns.\n"
"Only available when a light gun device is connected.\n"
"\n"
"Choose a size that is visible without covering targets."
msgstr ""
"準星大小\n"
"調整光線槍的螢幕準星大小。\n"
"僅在連接光線槍裝置時提供。\n"
"\n"
"請選擇清楚可見、又不會遮住目標的大小。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7673
msgid "VMU Settings"
msgstr "VMU 設定"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7679
msgid "When enabled, each game has its own VMU on port 1 of controller A"
msgstr "啟用後，每款遊戲都會在控制器 A 的連接埠 1 使用專屬 VMU。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7683
msgid ""
"Per Game VMU\n"
"When enabled, each game has its own VMU on port 1 of controller A.\n"
"Useful to prevent save-file conflicts between games."
msgstr ""
"個別遊戲 VMU\n"
"啟用後，每款遊戲都會在控制器 A 的連接埠 1 使用專屬 VMU。\n"
"可避免不同遊戲的存檔互相衝突。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7694
msgid "Use External VMU Storage"
msgstr "使用外接 VMU 儲存空間"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7695
msgid ""
"Enables read and write access to physical/external VMU storage via "
"DreamPicoPort or DreamPotato. VMUs may appear to reconnect after loading "
"state."
msgstr ""
"透過 DreamPicoPort 或 DreamPotato 啟用實體／外接 VMU 儲存空間的讀寫權限。載入存檔狀態後，VMU 可能會顯示重新連線。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7699
msgid ""
"Use External VMU Storage\n"
"Enables read and write access to physical/external VMU storage via DreamPicoPort or DreamPotato. VMUs may appear to reconnect after loading state."
msgstr ""
"使用外接 VMU 儲存空間\n"
"透過 DreamPicoPort 或 DreamPotato 啟用實體／外接 VMU 儲存空間的讀寫權限。載入存檔狀態後，VMU 可能會顯示重新連線。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7709
msgid "DreamPotato Integrated Mode"
msgstr "DreamPotato 整合模式"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7710
msgid ""
"Automatically launch DreamPotato (VMU emulator) using the standard VMU file "
"for the given slot."
msgstr "使用指定插槽的標準 VMU 檔案，自動啟動 DreamPotato（VMU 模擬器）。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7713
msgid ""
"DreamPotato Integrated Mode\n"
"Automatically launch DreamPotato (VMU emulator) using the standard VMU file for the given slot.\n"
"Applies to all slots which use a DreamPotato device.\n"
"When this is disabled, DreamPotato devices will connect to a manually-launched standalone instance instead."
msgstr ""
"DreamPotato 整合模式\n"
"使用指定插槽的標準 VMU 檔案，自動啟動 DreamPotato（VMU 模擬器）。\n"
"適用於所有使用 DreamPotato 裝置的插槽。\n"
"停用此功能後，DreamPotato 裝置會改為連線至手動啟動的獨立執行個體。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7722
msgid ""
"(!) DreamPotato executable not found. Please set DreamPotato Path in General"
" > Custom Paths."
msgstr "（！）找不到 DreamPotato 執行檔。請在「一般 > 自訂路徑」設定 DreamPotato 路徑。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7732
msgid "Network Configuration"
msgstr "網路設定"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7751
msgid "GGPO"
msgstr "GGPO"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7752
msgid "Naomi"
msgstr "Naomi"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7760
msgid "NetworkTypePopup"
msgstr "NetworkTypePopup"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7773
msgid "NetworkTypeSetting"
msgstr "NetworkTypeSetting"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7774
msgid "Choose which network feature is active."
msgstr "選擇要啟用的網路功能。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7777
msgid ""
"Network Type\n"
"Selects the active network mode:\n"
"GGPO for rollback netplay, Naomi for Naomi network games, or Battle Cable.\n"
"\n"
"Only one network type should be enabled at a time."
msgstr ""
"網路類型\n"
"選擇使用中的網路模式：\n"
"GGPO 用於回滾式網路對戰，Naomi 用於 Naomi 網路遊戲，或使用 Battle Cable。\n"
"\n"
"一次只能啟用一種網路類型。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7800
msgid "Host the game session"
msgstr "主辦遊戲連線"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7804
msgid ""
"Play as Player 1\n"
"When enabled, you host the session (Player 1).\n"
"Deselect to connect as Player 2."
msgstr ""
"以玩家 1 身分遊玩\n"
"啟用後，你會成為連線的主辦者（玩家 1）。\n"
"取消選取後會以玩家 2 身分連線。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7821
msgid ""
"GGPO Peer\n"
"Enter your peer's IP address (and optional port).\n"
"Use this when connecting directly without matchmaking."
msgstr ""
"GGPO 對端\n"
"輸入對方的 IP 位址（及選用連接埠）。\n"
"直接連線且不使用配對時，請使用此設定。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7833
msgid "GGPOFrameDelayPopup"
msgstr "GGPOFrameDelayPopup"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7834
msgid "Sets Frame Delay, advisable for sessions with ping >100 ms."
msgstr "設定影格延遲，Ping 高於 100 ms 時建議啟用。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7851
msgid "GGPOFrameDelaySetting"
msgstr "GGPOFrameDelaySetting"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7852
msgid "Extra buffering for higher ping sessions."
msgstr "為高 Ping 連線增加緩衝。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7855
msgid ""
"Frame Delay\n"
"Adds a fixed frame delay to help stabilize gameplay for higher-latency connections.\n"
"Often advisable when ping is > 100 ms.\n"
"\n"
"Too much delay increases input lag; use the lowest value that feels stable."
msgstr ""
"影格延遲\n"
"增加固定影格延遲，協助穩定高延遲連線的遊戲過程。\n"
"Ping 高於 100 ms 時通常建議啟用。\n"
"\n"
"延遲過高會增加輸入延遲；請使用體感穩定的最低數值。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7863
msgid "Analog Axes"
msgstr "類比軸"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7873
msgid "Left Thumbstick"
msgstr "左類比搖桿"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7875
msgid "GGPOAnalogAxesPopup"
msgstr "GGPOAnalogAxesPopup"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7886
msgid "GGPOAnalogAxesSetting"
msgstr "GGPOAnalogAxesSetting"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7887
msgid "Control how the left thumbstick is used in GGPO."
msgstr "設定左類比搖桿在 GGPO 中的用途。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7890
msgid ""
"Left Thumbstick (GGPO)\n"
"Configures how the left thumbstick is mapped during GGPO sessions:\n"
"Disabled, Horizontal only, or Full analog axes.\n"
"\n"
"Choose the option that matches the game and your preferred control style."
msgstr ""
"左類比搖桿（GGPO）\n"
"設定 GGPO 連線期間左類比搖桿的對應方式：\n"
"停用、僅水平，或完整類比軸。\n"
"\n"
"請選擇符合遊戲與偏好操作方式的選項。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7901
msgid "Open chat on message received"
msgstr "收到訊息時開啟聊天"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7905
msgid ""
"Enable Chat\n"
"Opens the chat window when a message is received during GGPO sessions."
msgstr ""
"啟用聊天\n"
"GGPO 連線期間收到訊息時開啟聊天視窗。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7914
msgid "Chat Auto-Close"
msgstr "自動關閉聊天"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7915
msgid "Automatically close chat window"
msgstr "自動關閉聊天視窗"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7919
msgid ""
"Chat Auto-Close\n"
"Automatically closes the chat window after a timeout.\n"
"Useful if you want chat notifications without leaving the overlay open."
msgstr ""
"自動關閉聊天\n"
"逾時後自動關閉聊天視窗。\n"
"若想接收聊天通知，但不想讓覆疊一直開著，此功能就很實用。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7930
msgid ""
"Chat Window Timeout\n"
"Controls how long the chat window stays open after receiving a new message.\n"
"\n"
"Increase this if you want more time to read messages.\n"
"Decrease it if you only want brief notifications without the overlay staying on screen."
msgstr ""
"聊天視窗逾時\n"
"控制收到新訊息後聊天視窗會保持開啟的時間。\n"
"\n"
"若想多留一些時間閱讀訊息，請增加數值。\n"
"若只想短暫接收通知，不希望覆疊持續顯示，請降低數值。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7940
msgid "Chat Window Timeout (s)"
msgstr "聊天視窗逾時（秒）"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7953
msgid ""
"Sets duration that chat window stays open after new message is received"
msgstr "設定收到新訊息後聊天視窗保持開啟的時間"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7964
msgid "Display netplay stats on screen"
msgstr "在螢幕上顯示網路對戰統計資料"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7968
msgid ""
"Network Statistics\n"
"Shows a small on-screen overlay with live netplay information.\n"
"This is useful for diagnosing stutter, desyncs, or “why does this feel laggy?” situations.\n"
"\n"
"If you are tuning settings for a stable experience, enable this along with the FPS counter and test during real gameplay.\n"
"Look for stable latency/jitter and minimal dropped or delayed packets."
msgstr ""
"網路統計資料\n"
"顯示網路對戰資訊的精簡螢幕覆疊。\n"
"可用於診斷卡頓、不同步，或「為什麼感覺這麼延遲？」等問題。\n"
"\n"
"若要調校穩定體驗，請一併啟用此功能與 FPS 計數器，並在實際遊戲中測試。\n"
"留意延遲／抖動是否穩定，以及封包遺失或延遲是否極少。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7984
msgid "Client"
msgstr "用戶端"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:7992
msgid "NetworkRolePopup"
msgstr "NetworkRolePopup"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8015
msgid "NetworkRoleSetting"
msgstr "NetworkRoleSetting"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8016
msgid "Choose the network role."
msgstr "選擇網路角色。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8019
msgid ""
"Network Role\n"
"Selects the active network role:\n"
"Server to create a local server for Naomi network games, client to connect to a server, satellite to monitor games that support it (Virtual-On Oratorio Tangram and Club Kart)\n"
"\n"
"If you cannot connect to each other, check firewalls/NAT rules and confirm both players are using the same game/version.\n"
"Use the Local Port setting if you need to match a specific port or avoid conflicts."
msgstr ""
"網路角色\n"
"選擇使用中的網路角色：\n"
"伺服器：建立 NAOMI 網路遊戲的本機伺服器。用戶端：連線至伺服器。衛星端：監看支援的遊戲（《Virtual-On Oratorio Tangram》和《Club Kart》）。\n"
"\n"
"若彼此無法連線，請檢查防火牆／NAT 規則，並確認兩位玩家使用相同的遊戲與版本。\n"
"若需使用特定連接埠或避免衝突，請使用「本機連接埠」設定。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8042
msgid ""
"Naomi Netplay: Server Address\n"
"Enter the host to connect to (for example: a hostname or an IP address).\n"
"If a port is supported by your setup, it is typically written as `host:port`.\n"
"\n"
"Leave this field blank to use automatic discovery (when available) on the default port.\n"
"If you have connection issues, try entering the host explicitly and verify your Local Port and firewall/NAT rules."
msgstr ""
"Naomi 網路對戰：伺服器位址\n"
"輸入要連線的主機（例如主機名稱或 IP 位址）。\n"
"若設定支援指定連接埠，通常會寫成 `host:port`。\n"
"\n"
"若要使用預設連接埠自動探索（如有支援），請將此欄留白。\n"
"若有連線問題，請明確輸入主機，並確認本機連接埠與防火牆／NAT 規則。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8056
msgid ""
"Local Port\n"
"Sets the local UDP port used for Naomi netplay / Battle Cable connections.\n"
"\n"
"If you cannot connect, make sure both players are using compatible settings and that your firewall/router is not blocking this port.\n"
"Only change this if you have a port conflict or you need to match a specific setup."
msgstr ""
"本機連接埠\n"
"設定 Naomi 網路對戰／Battle Cable 連線使用的本機 UDP 連接埠。\n"
"\n"
"若無法連線，請確認兩位玩家使用相容的設定，且防火牆／路由器未封鎖此連接埠。\n"
"只有在連接埠衝突或需要符合特定設定時才變更。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8103
msgid "Choose a unique word or number and share it with your opponent"
msgstr "選擇一組獨特的文字或數字，並分享給對手"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8130
msgid "Playing "
msgstr "遊玩中 "

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8140
msgid "Network Stats"
msgstr "網路統計資料"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8141
msgid "Display network statistics"
msgstr "顯示網路統計資料"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8145
msgid ""
"Network Statistics\n"
"Shows a small on-screen overlay with live connection information.\n"
"\n"
"Use this to diagnose lag spikes, unstable connections, or dropped packets during Battle Cable sessions.\n"
"For best results, enable the FPS counter too and test during actual gameplay."
msgstr ""
"網路統計資料\n"
"顯示即時連線資訊的精簡螢幕覆疊。\n"
"\n"
"用於診斷 Battle Cable 連線期間的延遲尖峰、不穩定連線或封包遺失。\n"
"若要獲得最佳結果，請一併啟用 FPS 計數器，並在實際遊戲中測試。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8170
msgid ""
"Battle Cable: Peer Address\n"
"Enter the opponent to connect to (hostname or IP address).\n"
"If your setup supports specifying a port, it is typically written as `host:port`.\n"
"\n"
"Leave this field blank to use automatic discovery (when available) on the default port.\n"
"If matchmaking fails, try entering the peer explicitly and verify your Local Port and firewall/NAT rules."
msgstr ""
"Battle Cable：對端位址\n"
"輸入要連線的對手（主機名稱或 IP 位址）。\n"
"若設定支援指定連接埠，通常會寫成 `host:port`。\n"
"\n"
"若要使用預設連接埠自動探索（如有支援），請將此欄留白。\n"
"若配對失敗，請明確輸入對端，並確認本機連接埠與防火牆／NAT 規則。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8182
msgid ""
"Local Port\n"
"Sets the local UDP port used for Battle Cable sessions.\n"
"\n"
"If you cannot connect, verify firewall/router rules and ensure both peers are using the same port.\n"
"Leave this at the default unless you have a reason to change it."
msgstr ""
"本機連接埠\n"
"設定 Battle Cable 連線使用的本機 UDP 連接埠。\n"
"\n"
"若無法連線，請確認防火牆／路由器規則，並確保兩端使用相同連接埠。\n"
"除非有變更理由，否則請保留預設值。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8220
msgid "Host for Maximum Speed mode"
msgstr "最高速度模式的主端"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8224
msgid ""
"Maximum Speed: Master Peer\n"
"Only used by Maximum Speed mode.\n"
"Exactly one peer must be the master for the session to work correctly.\n"
"\n"
"If you run into connection problems, try switching which player is master.\n"
"In general, the player with the more stable connection and lower latency is a good choice."
msgstr ""
"最高速度：主端\n"
"僅供最高速度模式使用。\n"
"連線中必須恰有一個對端設為主端，才能正常運作。\n"
"\n"
"若遇到連線問題，請嘗試切換由哪位玩家擔任主端。\n"
"一般而言，連線較穩定、延遲較低的玩家較適合擔任主端。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8245
msgid ""
"Enable UPnP\n"
"Attempts to automatically create the required port mappings on your router.\n"
"\n"
"This can make hosting/connecting easier on home networks, but it depends on your router supporting UPnP and allowing it.\n"
"If it does not work (or if you prefer not to use UPnP), disable this and use manual port forwarding instead."
msgstr ""
"啟用 UPnP\n"
"嘗試在路由器上自動建立必要的連接埠對應。\n"
"\n"
"若路由器支援並允許 UPnP，此功能可簡化家庭網路的主辦／連線流程。\n"
"若無法運作（或不想使用 UPnP），請停用此功能並改用手動連接埠轉送。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8255
msgid "Broadcast audio/video"
msgstr "廣播音訊／視訊"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8259
msgid ""
"Broadcast Digital Outputs\n"
"Exports certain arcade I/O “outputs” over the network (for example, values used by some Naomi driving/force-feedback setups).\n"
"\n"
"This is not a general gameplay video/audio streaming feature.\n"
"Enable it only if you are using external tooling or hardware that expects network output data."
msgstr ""
"廣播數位輸出\n"
"透過網路匯出特定街機 I/O「輸出」（例如部分 Naomi 賽車／力回饋設定使用的數值）。\n"
"\n"
"這不是一般的遊戲視訊／音訊串流功能。\n"
"只有在使用預期會接收網路輸出資料的外部工具或硬體時才啟用。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8268
msgid "Broadband Adapter"
msgstr "寬頻配接器"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8273
msgid ""
"Broadband Adapter (BBA)\n"
"Emulates the Dreamcast Ethernet Broadband Adapter (BBA) instead of the modem.\n"
"\n"
"Use this for games and features that expect Ethernet networking.\n"
"If a title expects the modem path (or you are troubleshooting connectivity), try toggling this and re-testing."
msgstr ""
"寬頻配接器（BBA）\n"
"模擬 Dreamcast 乙太網路寬頻配接器（BBA），而非數據機。\n"
"\n"
"用於需要乙太網路連線的遊戲與功能。\n"
"若遊戲需要數據機連線，或正在疑難排解連線問題，請嘗試切換此設定並重新測試。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8283
msgid "DCNet Cloud"
msgstr "DCNet Cloud"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8284
msgid "Dreamcast Internet via cloud"
msgstr "透過雲端連線至 Dreamcast 網際網路"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8288
msgid ""
"DCNet Cloud\n"
"Routes Dreamcast networking through a cloud-backed service instead of relying entirely on your local network configuration.\n"
"\n"
"This can simplify getting “online” in certain scenarios, but it also changes the networking path.\n"
"If you have trouble connecting, try toggling this setting and re-testing with the same game and the same network options."
msgstr ""
"DCNet Cloud\n"
"透過雲端服務轉送 Dreamcast 網路連線，不必完全依賴本機網路設定。\n"
"\n"
"在某些情況下，這可簡化「上線」流程，但也會改變網路路徑。\n"
"若無法連線，請嘗試切換此設定，並使用相同遊戲與網路選項重新測試。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8299
msgid "ISP Username"
msgstr "ISP 使用者名稱"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8300
msgid ""
"The ISP user name stored in the console Flash RAM. Used by some online games"
" as the player name. Leave blank to keep the current Flash RAM value"
msgstr "儲存在主機 Flash RAM 中的 ISP 使用者名稱。部分線上遊戲會將其作為玩家名稱。留白可保留目前的 Flash RAM 值。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8317
msgid "DNS Server"
msgstr "DNS 伺服器"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8325
msgid ""
"DNS Server\n"
"Overrides the DNS server used by the emulated network stack.\n"
"\n"
"Only change this if you know you need a specific DNS provider or you are debugging connectivity.\n"
"Note: When DCNet Cloud is enabled, DNS behavior may be handled differently and this field may not apply."
msgstr ""
"DNS 伺服器\n"
"覆寫模擬網路堆疊使用的 DNS 伺服器。\n"
"\n"
"只有在需要特定 DNS 服務供應商或正在偵錯連線問題時才變更。\n"
"注意：啟用 DCNet Cloud 時，DNS 行為可能不同，此欄位可能不適用。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8338
msgid "Multiboard"
msgstr "多機板"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8353
msgid "Advanced Configuration"
msgstr "進階設定"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8357
msgid "CPU & Emulation"
msgstr "CPU 與模擬"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8369
msgid "CpuModePopup"
msgstr "CpuModePopup"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8378
msgid ""
"CPU Mode: Dynarec\n"
"Recommended for almost everyone.\n"
"Uses the dynamic recompiler (JIT) for the best performance.\n"
"\n"
"If a specific game is crashing or behaving incorrectly, switching to the Interpreter can be a useful compatibility test."
msgstr ""
"CPU 模式：Dynarec\n"
"幾乎所有使用者都建議使用。\n"
"使用動態重編譯器（JIT）以獲得最佳效能。\n"
"\n"
"若特定遊戲當機或行為異常，切換至直譯器可用於相容性測試。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8384
msgid ""
"CPU Mode: Interpreter\n"
"Highest compatibility, lowest performance.\n"
"Runs the SH4 in interpreter mode which is much slower than Dynarec.\n"
"\n"
"Use this mainly for troubleshooting hard-to-reproduce bugs, or for rare titles that misbehave under Dynarec."
msgstr ""
"CPU 模式：直譯器\n"
"相容性最高，效能最低。\n"
"以直譯器模式執行 SH4，速度比 Dynarec 慢得多。\n"
"\n"
"主要用於疑難排解難以重現的錯誤，或處理少數在 Dynarec 下行為異常的遊戲。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8399
msgid "CpuModeSetting"
msgstr "CpuModeSetting"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8400
msgid ""
"Use the dynamic recompiler for speed, or interpreter for compatibility."
msgstr "使用動態重編譯器提升速度，或使用直譯器改善相容性。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8403
msgid ""
"CPU Mode\n"
"Controls how Hollycast emulates the SH4 CPU.\n"
"\n"
"Dynarec is dramatically faster and is the normal choice for gameplay.\n"
"Interpreter is much slower, but can be helpful for compatibility testing.\n"
"\n"
"If you are troubleshooting a game-specific issue, switch modes and re-test the exact same scene to compare behavior."
msgstr ""
"CPU 模式\n"
"控制 Hollycast 模擬 SH4 CPU 的方式。\n"
"\n"
"Dynarec 的速度快得多，是一般遊玩的常用選項。\n"
"直譯器速度慢得多，但有助於測試相容性。\n"
"\n"
"若要疑難排解特定遊戲問題，請切換模式，並在完全相同的場景重新測試比較。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8418
msgid "Sh4ClockPopup"
msgstr "Sh4ClockPopup"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8420
msgid ""
"Adjusts the emulated SH4 CPU clock. Default is 200 MHz.\n"
"Higher values may reduce CPU-side frame drops in some games, but can also break timing.\n"
"Lower values can reduce CPU load, but may cause slowdowns or audio/video instability."
msgstr ""
"調整模擬的 SH4 CPU 時脈。預設為 200 MHz。\n"
"提高數值可減少部分遊戲的 CPU 端掉影格，但也可能破壞時序。\n"
"降低數值可減輕 CPU 負載，但可能導致速度變慢或音訊／視訊不穩定。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8439
msgid "Sh4ClockSetting"
msgstr "Sh4ClockSetting"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8440
msgid "Over/Underclock the main SH4 CPU."
msgstr "提高／降低 SH4 主 CPU 時脈。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8443
msgid ""
"SH4 Clock\n"
"Overclocks/underclocks the emulated Dreamcast CPU.\n"
"\n"
"Default is 200 MHz.\n"
"Increasing the clock can help some CPU-limited games maintain full speed, but it can also introduce timing problems, bugs, or instability.\n"
"Decreasing the clock can lower CPU requirements, but may reduce performance or cause glitches.\n"
"\n"
"If you change this, re-test gameplay with the FPS counter enabled and keep adjustments small."
msgstr ""
"SH4 時脈\n"
"提高或降低模擬 Dreamcast CPU 的時脈。\n"
"\n"
"預設為 200 MHz。\n"
"提高時脈可協助部分受 CPU 限制的遊戲維持全速，但也可能導致時序問題、錯誤或不穩定。\n"
"降低時脈可減少 CPU 需求，但可能降低效能或造成圖形錯誤。\n"
"\n"
"若變更此設定，請啟用 FPS 計數器重新測試遊戲，並以小幅度調整。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8457
msgid "Fast-Forward Speed"
msgstr "快轉速度"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8459
msgid "FastForwardSpeedLimitPopup"
msgstr "FastForwardSpeedLimitPopup"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8461
msgid ""
"Sets a cap for Fast-Forward speed.\n"
"Values below Infinite apply frame pacing while Fast-Forward is active.\n"
"Infinite preserves the current uncapped behavior."
msgstr ""
"設定快轉速度上限。\n"
"低於「無上限」的數值會在快轉時套用影格節奏控制。\n"
"「無上限」會保留目前不設上限的行為。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8488
msgid "FastForwardSpeedLimitSetting"
msgstr "FastForwardSpeedLimitSetting"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8489
msgid "Cap Fast-Forward speed or leave it Infinite."
msgstr "設定快轉速度上限，或維持無上限。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8492
msgid ""
"Fast-Forward Speed\n"
"Controls the Fast-Forward cap while Fast-Forward is active.\n"
"\n"
"Set this below Infinite if you want a controlled speed-up instead of running as fast as possible.\n"
"Infinite keeps today's uncapped Fast-Forward behavior.\n"
"\n"
"Use moderate values first, then raise or lower based on how smooth gameplay and audio feel."
msgstr ""
"快轉速度\n"
"控制啟用快轉時的速度上限。\n"
"\n"
"若想要可控的加速，而非盡可能提高執行速度，請設定為低於「無上限」的數值。\n"
"「無上限」會保留目前不設上限的快轉行為。\n"
"\n"
"先使用適中的數值，再依遊戲與音訊的流暢度提高或降低。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8504
msgid "Fast-Forward Audio"
msgstr "快轉音訊"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8505
msgid "Play audio during Fast-Forward"
msgstr "快轉時播放音訊"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8509
msgid ""
"Fast-Forward Audio\n"
"Controls whether audio plays while Fast-Forward is active.\n"
"\n"
"When enabled, Fast-Forward audio plays at 35% volume to keep it usable without being too harsh.\n"
"When disabled, Fast-Forward keeps the current muted-audio behavior."
msgstr ""
"快轉音訊\n"
"控制快轉時是否播放音訊。\n"
"\n"
"啟用後，快轉音訊會以 35% 音量播放，避免音量過大並保持可聽。\n"
"停用後，快轉時會沿用目前靜音的行為。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8522
msgid "High Level Emulation BIOS"
msgstr "高階模擬 BIOS"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8526
msgid ""
"HLE BIOS\n"
"Uses a High Level Emulation BIOS implementation instead of a real BIOS.\n"
"\n"
"This can reduce CPU overhead and simplifies setup, but it can be less accurate than using a real BIOS.\n"
"If you encounter game-specific boot issues or unusual behavior, try disabling HLE BIOS (and using a real BIOS if available) for maximum compatibility."
msgstr ""
"HLE BIOS\n"
"使用高階模擬 BIOS 實作，而非實際 BIOS。\n"
"\n"
"這可減少 CPU 負載並簡化設定，但準確度可能不如實際 BIOS。\n"
"若遇到特定遊戲的啟動問題或異常行為，請嘗試停用 HLE BIOS（若有實際 BIOS，也可改用實際 BIOS），以獲得最高相容性。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8536
msgid "Multi-threading"
msgstr "多執行緒"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8537
msgid "Use additional CPU threads"
msgstr "使用額外的 CPU 執行緒"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8541
msgid ""
"Multi-threading\n"
"Allows Hollycast to use more than one CPU thread for certain emulation/rendering work.\n"
"\n"
"On modern multi-core devices this can improve performance or reduce stutter.\n"
"On some drivers/devices it can introduce instability or odd timing issues.\n"
"\n"
"If you see new crashes, visual glitches, or inconsistent frame pacing after enabling it, try turning it off and re-testing."
msgstr ""
"多執行緒\n"
"允許 Hollycast 在部分模擬／渲染工作中使用多個 CPU 執行緒。\n"
"\n"
"在現代多核心裝置上，可提升效能或減少卡頓。\n"
"在某些驅動程式／裝置上，可能導致不穩定或時序異常。\n"
"\n"
"若啟用後出現當機、畫面錯誤或影格節奏不穩，請嘗試關閉並重新測試。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8554
msgid "32MB RAM"
msgstr "32MB RAM"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8555
msgid "Extended memory (32MB)"
msgstr "延伸記憶體（32MB）"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8559
msgid ""
"32MB RAM (Memory Mod)\n"
"Enables an extended-memory mode (not standard Dreamcast hardware).\n"
"\n"
"Only use this if a specific title/homebrew explicitly requires it.\n"
"Because it changes the memory map, it can break games, cause graphical corruption, or lead to crashes.\n"
"\n"
"If you are unsure, leave this disabled."
msgstr ""
"32MB RAM（記憶體模組）\n"
"啟用延伸記憶體模式（非標準 Dreamcast 硬體）。\n"
"\n"
"只有在特定遊戲／自製遊戲明確要求時才使用。\n"
"此功能會變更記憶體映射，可能導致遊戲無法運作、圖形毀損或當機。\n"
"\n"
"若不確定，請保持停用。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8569
msgid "Debugging"
msgstr "偵錯"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8577
msgid "Serial console output"
msgstr "序列主控台輸出"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8581
msgid ""
"Serial Console\n"
"Enables serial console output for debugging.\n"
"\n"
"Most users should leave this off.\n"
"Enable it only if you are debugging, capturing logs, or using tools that rely on serial output."
msgstr ""
"序列主控台\n"
"啟用序列主控台輸出以進行偵錯。\n"
"\n"
"大多數使用者應保持關閉。\n"
"只有在偵錯、擷取記錄，或使用依賴序列輸出的工具時才啟用。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8593
msgid "GDB Server"
msgstr "GDB 伺服器"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8594
msgid "GDB debug server"
msgstr "GDB 偵錯伺服器"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8598
msgid ""
"GDB Server\n"
"Starts a GDB debug server for developers.\n"
"\n"
"When enabled, Hollycast can pause startup and wait for a debugger to attach.\n"
"Leave this disabled unless you are actively debugging."
msgstr ""
"GDB 伺服器\n"
"啟動供開發者使用的 GDB 偵錯伺服器。\n"
"\n"
"啟用後，Hollycast 可能會暫停啟動並等待偵錯工具連線。\n"
"除非正在進行偵錯，否則請保持停用。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8613
msgid "Wait for Connection"
msgstr "等待連線"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8614
msgid "Wait for debugger to connect"
msgstr "等待偵錯工具連線"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8618
msgid ""
"Wait for Connection\n"
"Delays emulation until the debugger connects to the GDB server.\n"
"\n"
"Useful when you need to catch very early boot issues.\n"
"Disable this for normal play."
msgstr ""
"等待連線\n"
"延遲模擬，直到偵錯工具連線至 GDB 伺服器。\n"
"\n"
"需要擷取啟動初期問題時，此功能很實用。\n"
"一般遊玩時請停用。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8629
msgid ""
"GDB Port\n"
"Sets the TCP port used by the built-in GDB debug server.\n"
"\n"
"Default is 3263.\n"
"Only change this if you have a port conflict or you need to match your debugging tool configuration."
msgstr ""
"GDB 連接埠\n"
"設定內建 GDB 偵錯伺服器使用的 TCP 連接埠。\n"
"\n"
"預設為 3263。\n"
"只有在連接埠衝突，或需要符合偵錯工具設定時才變更。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8639
msgid "GDB Port"
msgstr "GDB 連接埠"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8651
msgid "Default port is 3263"
msgstr "預設連接埠為 3263"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8666
msgid "Save log output to file"
msgstr "將記錄輸出儲存至檔案"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8670
msgid ""
"Log to File\n"
"Saves log output to a file on disk.\n"
"\n"
"This is helpful when you need to share logs for troubleshooting, but it can increase I/O and may reduce performance on slower storage.\n"
"If you enable this, try to reproduce the issue, then disable it again to avoid unnecessary disk usage."
msgstr ""
"記錄至檔案\n"
"將記錄輸出儲存在磁碟上的檔案中。\n"
"\n"
"需要分享記錄以進行疑難排解時，此功能很實用，但會增加 I/O，並可能降低較慢儲存裝置的效能。\n"
"啟用後，請重現問題，再停用此功能，避免不必要的磁碟用量。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8679
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "記錄"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8684
msgid "Notice"
msgstr "通知"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8684
msgid "Info"
msgstr "資訊"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8684
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "偵錯"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8692
msgid "Log Verbosity"
msgstr "記錄詳細程度"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8694
msgid "LogVerbosityPopup"
msgstr "LogVerbosityPopup"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8703
msgid ""
"Log Verbosity: Notice\n"
"Minimal information.\n"
"Best for normal usage when you only want important notices."
msgstr ""
"記錄詳細程度：通知\n"
"僅提供最少資訊。\n"
"一般使用時最適合只查看重要通知的情況。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8708
msgid ""
"Log Verbosity: Error\n"
"Only errors.\n"
"Useful when you want to reduce log noise and focus on failures."
msgstr ""
"記錄詳細程度：錯誤\n"
"僅記錄錯誤。\n"
"適合減少記錄雜訊並專注於失敗問題。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8713
msgid ""
"Log Verbosity: Warning\n"
"Errors and warnings.\n"
"A good balance for general troubleshooting with moderate verbosity."
msgstr ""
"記錄詳細程度：警告\n"
"記錄錯誤與警告。\n"
"適合一般疑難排解，提供適中的詳細程度。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8718
msgid ""
"Log Verbosity: Info\n"
"Adds informational messages.\n"
"Helpful when investigating subsystems without going full debug spam."
msgstr ""
"記錄詳細程度：資訊\n"
"加入資訊訊息。\n"
"適合調查子系統，又不會像偵錯模式般產生大量記錄。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8723
msgid ""
"Log Verbosity: Debug\n"
"Most verbose.\n"
"Can be very noisy and may impact performance; use temporarily when debugging."
msgstr ""
"記錄詳細程度：偵錯\n"
"資訊最詳盡。\n"
"記錄可能非常繁雜並影響效能；偵錯時請暫時使用。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8738
msgid "LogVerbositySetting"
msgstr "LogVerbositySetting"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8739
msgid "Control the verbosity of log output"
msgstr "控制記錄輸出的詳細程度"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8742
msgid ""
"Log Verbosity\n"
"Controls how much information Hollycast writes to the log.\n"
"\n"
"Lower verbosity is cleaner and faster.\n"
"Higher verbosity is useful when diagnosing problems, but can generate a lot of output (and can impact performance in extreme cases).\n"
"\n"
"For troubleshooting, start with Warning or Info, then use Debug only if you need deeper detail."
msgstr ""
"記錄詳細程度\n"
"控制 Hollycast 寫入記錄的資訊量。\n"
"\n"
"較低的詳細程度更簡潔、速度也較快。\n"
"較高的詳細程度有助於診斷問題，但可能產生大量輸出（極端情況下也會影響效能）。\n"
"\n"
"疑難排解時，請先使用「警告」或「資訊」，需要更多細節時再使用「偵錯」。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8751
msgid "Log Categories"
msgstr "記錄類別"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8823
msgid "Log Server"
msgstr "記錄伺服器"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8830
msgid "Log to this hostname[:port] with UDP. Default port is 31667."
msgstr "透過 UDP 將記錄傳送至此主機名稱[:port]。預設連接埠為 31667。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8837
msgid "Profiling"
msgstr "效能分析"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8842
msgid "Enable Profiler"
msgstr "啟用效能分析器"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8843
msgid "Performance profiling"
msgstr "效能分析"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8847
msgid ""
"Profiler\n"
"Enables performance profiling tools for developers and power users.\n"
"\n"
"This can add overhead. Leave it off unless you are actively profiling performance."
msgstr ""
"效能分析器\n"
"為開發者與進階使用者啟用效能分析工具。\n"
"\n"
"此功能可能增加負載。除非正在分析效能，否則請保持關閉。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8859
msgid "Display in GUI"
msgstr "在圖形介面中顯示"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8860
msgid "Show profiler overlay"
msgstr "顯示效能分析器覆疊"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8864
msgid ""
"Profiler: Display in GUI\n"
"Draws profiler output as an in-game overlay.\n"
"\n"
"Useful for quickly spotting spikes or expensive subsystems while reproducing a performance issue."
msgstr ""
"效能分析器：在圖形介面中顯示\n"
"以遊戲內覆疊方式顯示效能分析器輸出。\n"
"\n"
"重現效能問題時，可快速找出尖峰或耗用資源較多的子系統。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8873
msgid "Output to Terminal"
msgstr "輸出至終端機"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8874
msgid "Write profiler to terminal"
msgstr "將效能分析器輸出至終端機"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8878
msgid ""
"Profiler: Output to Terminal\n"
"Writes profiler output to the terminal/console.\n"
"\n"
"Useful when capturing data during automated runs or when you want to copy/paste profiling output."
msgstr ""
"效能分析器：輸出至終端機\n"
"將效能分析器輸出寫入終端機／主控台。\n"
"\n"
"在自動化執行期間擷取資料，或想要複製效能分析輸出時，此功能很實用。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8890
msgid "Experimental Features"
msgstr "實驗性功能"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8895
msgid "(!) Texture Dumping"
msgstr "（！）紋理傾印"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8900
msgid "Texture Dumping"
msgstr "紋理傾印"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8901
msgid "Dump textures to files"
msgstr "將紋理傾印至檔案"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8905
msgid ""
"Texture Dumping\n"
"Saves textures to disk as they are used.\n"
"\n"
"This is mainly for creating or debugging custom texture packs.\n"
"It can create a large number of files quickly and may reduce performance due to disk I/O.\n"
"\n"
"Enable it only when you specifically need a dump, then disable it again."
msgstr ""
"紋理傾印\n"
"將使用中的紋理儲存至磁碟。\n"
"\n"
"主要用於建立或偵錯自訂紋理包。\n"
"此功能可能很快產生大量檔案，並因磁碟 I/O 降低效能。\n"
"\n"
"只有在確實需要傾印時才啟用，完成後請再次停用。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8919
msgid "Dump Replaced"
msgstr "傾印已替換紋理"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8920
msgid "Dump replaced textures too"
msgstr "也傾印已替換的紋理"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8924
msgid ""
"Dump Replaced Textures\n"
"Also dumps textures even when they are being replaced by a custom texture pack.\n"
"\n"
"This is useful when comparing originals vs replacements, but it increases disk usage even more.\n"
"Leave this off unless you are actively working on textures."
msgstr ""
"傾印已替換紋理\n"
"即使紋理已由自訂紋理包替換，也一併傾印。\n"
"\n"
"方便比較原始紋理與替換紋理，但會進一步增加磁碟用量。\n"
"除非正在處理紋理，否則請保持關閉。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8948
msgid "Developer Tools"
msgstr "開發者工具"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8957
msgid ""
"Specify lua filename to use. Should be located in Hollycast config folder. "
"Defaults to flycast.lua when empty."
msgstr "指定要使用的 Lua 檔名。檔案應位於 Hollycast 設定資料夾中。留白時預設為 flycast.lua。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8965
msgid "Crash Reports"
msgstr "當機報告"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8966
msgid "Auto-upload crash reports"
msgstr "自動上傳當機報告"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8970
msgid ""
"Crash Reports\n"
"Automatically uploads crash reports to help developers diagnose and fix issues.\n"
"\n"
"Crash reports typically include technical details about the crash and environment.\n"
"Leave this enabled if you want to help improve stability; disable it if you prefer not to send crash data."
msgstr ""
"當機報告\n"
"自動上傳當機報告，協助開發者診斷並修正問題。\n"
"\n"
"當機報告通常包含當機與環境的技術詳細資料。\n"
"若願意協助改善穩定性，請保持啟用；若不想傳送當機資料，請停用。"

#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:8982
msgid "Virtual Memory Addresses"
msgstr "虛擬記憶體位址"

